If any **Critical** or **High** risk items were found in Passes 1–3, build a quick dependency map:

```
Modified: useAuthContext (context)
  └── Consumed by:
        ├── Header.tsx          ← re-renders on every auth state change
        ├── ProtectedRoute.tsx  ← controls access to 8 routes
        ├── ProfilePage.tsx     ← reads user.name, user.avatar
        └── useUserPermissions.ts ← derives permissions from auth state
